{"type":"message","id":"36315296","parentId":"1eaf16ea","timestamp":"2026-03-25T00:03:05.184Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我看到图片了，是关于配置千问3和阿里云Coding API的问题。用户说他们配置了但是连不上，报错。\n\n从图片中可以看到：\n1. 用户配置了千问3 (qwen): baseUrl https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/apps/anthropic, key: sk-04cbf23f1bd442cbb58d21ed1c43c095\n2. 用户配置了阿里云Coding API: baseUrl https://coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com/v1, key: sk-sp-93e3b0797c3c42c287388d999453b016\n\n用户说调用千问3可以，但是阿里云Coding Plan连不上。\n\n让我再看看用户第二条消息，他提供了阿里云Coding API的详细信息：\n- base url: https://coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com/v1\n- key: sk-sp-93e3b0797c3c42c287388d999453b016\n\n这个key和我之前配置的不一样！之前用户给的是 sk-sp-93e3b0797c3c42c287388d999453b016 (一样的)，但图片中显示的key是带 -sp- 前缀的。\n\n让我检查一下当前的 openclaw.json 配置，看看有什么问题。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"看到图片了！你说配置了千问3和阿里云Coding，但阿里云连不上。让我检查一下当前配置：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_c7iad4n1cm1d_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /home/gem/workspace/agent/openclaw.json | grep -A 20 '\"qwen\"'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":195,"output":346,"cacheRead":38973,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39514,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774396976000}}
