{"type":"message","id":"1655449e","parentId":"2a3dbd44","timestamp":"2026-03-25T00:03:24.101Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"问题找到了！\n\n1. 千问3的baseUrl应该是 `https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1` (兼容模式)，而不是 `https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/apps/anthropic`\n2. 阿里云Coding API 应该使用 `https://coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com/v1`（注意是 coding.dashscope 而不是 dashscope）\n\n另外，图片中显示的 API key 是 `sk-sp-93e3b0797c3c42c287388d999453b016`，这是一个 Coding Plan 的 key，需要确认它是否支持 Anthropic 协议。\n\n让我更新配置：\n1. 千问3的baseUrl改为兼容模式\n2. 添加阿里云Coding模型配置\n\n但是等等，我需要确认一下阿里云Coding API支持什么协议。用户说是\"兼容 OpenAI 接口协议\"，所以应该用 openai-completions。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"问题找到了！\n\n1. **千问3** - baseUrl 应该是 `https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1`（兼容模式），不是 `/apps/anthropic`\n2. **阿里云Coding** - 需要新增配置，用 `coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com` 而不是 `dashscope.aliyuncs.com`\n\n让我修复：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ii108yrpfmhz_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/openclaw.json","newText":"\"qwen\": {\n        \"baseUrl\": \"https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1\",\n        \"apiKey\": {\n          \"source\": \"provider\",\n          \"provider\": \"qwen3-provider\"\n        },\n        \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n        \"models\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"qwen3-235b\",\n            \"name\": \"千问3\",\n            \"reasoning\": true,\n            \"input\": [\n              \"text\"\n            ],\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"input\": 0,\n              \"output\": 0\n            },\n            \"contextWindow\": 100000,\n            \"maxTokens\": 8192\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"aliyun-coding\": {\n        \"baseUrl\": \"https://coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com/v1\",\n        \"apiKey\": {\n          \"source\": \"value\",\n          \"value\": \"sk-sp-93e3b0797c3c42c287388d999453b016\"\n        },\n        \"api\": \"openai-